Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,DO NOT TRANSLATE THE FOLLOWING TERMS
Comment: 0,0:00:00.01,0:00:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,ROP, DRR, H1, IWR, IntraWorld Railway, Quartz Industries, Quartz Media, WorldWidePixel, Ploopy, Ploopy504, Blurry, Rowan, TheClashFruit, NormalFery, Myadeleines NCB, BlurBank, Northern, Northern Party, ROB, Weed Farm (<- refer to it as Wheat Farm), CRSS, b1.7.3, b1.8.1
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.13,0:00:32.20,Default - Opaque black box,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1280,930.666)}ROP Tour 2026
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.20,0:00:42.23,Bottom-center alligned; Opaque Box,,0,0,0,,This is the terrain of the Republic of Panorama
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.23,0:00:52.23,Bottom-center alligned; Opaque Box,,0,0,0,,It is a mix of terrain generations from b1.0, b1.8.1, and all the release versions that came after.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.95,0:00:57.18,Bottom-center alligned; Opaque Box,,0,0,0,,In ROP, we have two main Train-based Transport Providers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.18,0:01:01.25,Bottom-center alligned; Opaque Box,,0,0,0,,This is the IntraWorld Railway, the first railway system in ROP, originally built by NormalFery.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.25,0:01:07.11,Bottom-center alligned; Opaque Box,,0,0,0,,It was then renovated and modernised by TheClashFruit and Myadeleines, using Creative Mode, which became a controversial decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.11,0:01:13.23,Bottom-center alligned; Opaque Box,,0,0,0,,What you're seeing now is Northern's H1 Metro. It was built to connect ROP and Chunkia.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.23,0:01:18.71,Bottom-center alligned; Opaque Box,,0,0,0,,It has many stops in important parts of Panorama.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.71,0:01:24.23,Bottom-center alligned; Opaque Box,,0,0,0,,We are now going to visit ROP's Underground Tunnels. They connect many iconic places!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.23,0:01:30.35,Bottom-center alligned; Opaque Box,,0,0,0,,ROP Citizens built these when the surface got too crowded. It connects convenient paths & businesses.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.25,0:01:43.35,Bottom-center alligned; Opaque Box,,0,0,0,,The Gay Bar, The Northern Complex, H1, The Info Centre, and Metro Neue all connect here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.60,0:01:57.23,Bottom-center alligned; Opaque Box,,0,0,0,,Let's now visit the area on the west side of The Info Centre.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.23,0:02:03.15,Bottom-center alligned; Opaque Box,,0,0,0,,This is the NCB BlurBank vein. NCB used to be an independent bank operated by TCF, but it was eventually merged with BlurBank.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.15,0:02:09.03,Bottom-center alligned; Opaque Box,,0,0,0,,ROP Citizens have a weird obsession with The Letter T and its upside down version.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.96,0:02:20.71,Bottom-center alligned; Opaque Box,,0,0,0,,This is The Northern Complex. A residential and commercial building, ran by The Northern Company.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.58,0:02:32.45,Bottom-center alligned; Opaque Box,,0,0,0,,Here, we can see BlurBank. The biggest bank in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.45,0:02:38.43,Bottom-center alligned; Opaque Box,,0,0,0,,Banking services are no longer that popular, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.31,0:02:44.28,Bottom-center alligned; Opaque Box,,0,0,0,,This is The Info Centre. For years, it was the 'official' information source.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.28,0:02:47.28,Bottom-center alligned; Opaque Box,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, it became unmaintained and ended up not being used anymore.





